  "notes": "Hot-plug spec modelled on the Activepieces Stripe piece; replaces the compiled src/toolkits/stripe.rs at runtime. Form bodies with bracketed nested keys (metadata[k], line_items[0][price]); cursor pagination via starting_after (last id) + has_more.",
